window.products.push({"id":477044,"name":"Lafocuse Black Wall Clock with Date,Month,Day of Week and Temperature, Silent Non-Ticking Battery Operated Clock for Living Room Bedroom Office Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RhrBS-KjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LCD Calendar & Thermometer: Adopting large HD LCD screen that shows the month, date, the day of the week and temperature clearly. With black arabic numerals and black hands to stand out over a white dial, it is easy to read time everywhere in your home.(The LCD Calendar needs one AAA Alkaline battery or Carbon Zinc battery.) Easy to Set Date: Press \"SET\", when \"Year\" flashes, press \"UP\" or \"DOWN\" to adjust years. In the same way to adjust month and date. Continue press \"SET\" to enter the window of other settings. Finally when it returns to the date window, you can press \"UP\" to adjust \"Temperature\" to Fahrenheit or Celsius. \"Week\" and \"Temperature\" change automatically. For detailed settings, please refer to the instruction manual in the package. High Quality: Excellent HD glass front cover, sturdy ABS back cover, black plastic frame, quality movement, metal hands make our clock work longer. After you install it on the wall, it will run fluently. Accurate Time & No Annoying Ticking: Precise quartz movement guarantee accurate time. After operated by 1 AA battery, silent non-ticking movement suitable for who need to concentrate on work or enjoy a quiet sleeping environment. Broad Application: Diameter in 12\" (30 cm). A practical addition to the dining rooms, living rooms, family rooms, bedrooms, study room, office, lounge, hall or kitchen ect. The wall clock is well packed, you can also send it to your friends or family as a holiday gift. 3-Year Quality Assurance: If the clock has any quality problem in 3 years, please no hesitate to contact us. We'll give you a satisfied solution as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RhrBS-KjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lafocuse","source_asin":"B08Q2TQXBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q2TQXBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q2TQXBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477045,"name":"Seiko QXM494BLH Japanese Quartz Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AuUJBgVDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description LIGHT BROWN WOODEN CASE, VOLUME CONTROL, THREE \"AA\" BATTERIES REQUIRED The Seiko Story From Humble beginnings, Kintaro Hattori’s Vision for Seiko has become reality. A consuming passion for excellence - imprinted in our Corporate DNA passed from generation to generation. Seiko, for 125 years committed to the art and science of time. A culture of innovation connects a 19th century Tokyo clock shop with 20th century advances in timekeeping to an extraordinary 21st century \"quiet revolution.\" Continually driven by dedication and passion, established a multitude of world’s first technologies… transforming the principles of timekeeping. The first quartz wristwatch – changed the history of time. The first Kinetic – marked a new era in quartz watch technology. In 1969, Seiko Astron, the first quartz wristwatch - was introduced. In an instant, Seiko exponentially improved the accuracy of wristwatches –And Seiko technology firmly established today’s standard in Olympic and sports timing. 1984, another celebrated first – Kinetic Technology – powered by body movement. Kinetic – a quartz mechanism with unparalleled accuracy –the driving force behind more world’s firsts. Kinetic Chronograph – the next generation of high performance timekeeping. Kinetic Auto Relay – automatically resets to the correct time. Kinetic Perpetual - combining the date perfect technology of perpetual calendar with the genius of Kinetic Auto Relay. And now Kinetic Direct Drive – move, and the watch is powered automatically. Or hand wind it and see the power you are generating in real time. In the realm of fine watches, time is measured by Seiko innovation – A heritage of dedication to the art and science of time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AuUJBgVDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEIKO","source_asin":"B00DQVOXB2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DQVOXB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DQVOXB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
