window.products.push({"id":477109,"name":"Bacova Guild \"Coastal Moonlight Memory Foam Bath Rug, 20 by 34-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A7wrjyDZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Coastal Moonlight heat transfer print memory foam bath rug is made of foam and polyester facing. Sink your feet into the comfortable memory foam of this elegant pale blue and beige shell pattern and capture the feeling of walking on the beach. Machine washable. Collect the entire shell ensemble with matching bath accessories, bath towels and shower curtain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A7wrjyDZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bacova Guild","source_asin":"B01N03RW4P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N03RW4P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N03RW4P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477110,"name":"Dansk Rondure Stainless Flatware 20 Piece Place Set: Four 5 Piece Place Sets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31nsTt0C1jL._AC_.jpg","description":"Rondure Stainless Flatware, Silverware by Dansk Minimalist perfection! Each piece is an expression of geometric purity, with knives so exquisitely balanced, they stand vertically on end, and spoons that are perfectly round. Rondure is one of the few flatware patterns that offer completely round spoon bowls, but are definitely more modern in style. It also features one of our favorite knives, with the offset blade that gives you a wider handle to get more leverage on. Cutting becomes so much easier that you'll wish you hadn't suffered with the inferior knives in your last pattern (at least, that's what one customer told us).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31nsTt0C1jL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dansk","source_asin":"B00GJW3LTK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GJW3LTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GJW3LTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477111,"name":"Saltwater Coral Wall Decorations For Living Room, Beach Wall Decor - 10 Macro Images of Zoanthids, Animal Print Series Wall Pictures, Ocean Wall Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71moWTvrBxL._AC_.jpg","description":"This collection consists of (10) Prints that are 8\"x10\"each. The prints contain manyw ell known zoanthids such as Candy Apples, Rastas, Lakers and more. These images are a part of her larger collection, Zoanthids by Christina. Christina has created the largest digital collection of these animals in print, with over 270 unique variations photographed. To note - these variations represent a much larger and grander ocean than many can imagine - while many ocean explorers focus on the hard corals - or trees per se, Zoanthids by Christina focuses on the small delicate soft corals, much like small tiny delicate flowers. Zoanthids are often overlooked in the wild as they close up and hide their beautiful patterns and colors. Working with her Nikon 850, Christina captured these animals using a unique underwater housing unit and her 105 macro lens. Although these animals appear large in these images, many of these animals are only the size of a pencil eraser.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71moWTvrBxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zoanthids by Christina","source_asin":"B0BML1X8XK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BML1X8XK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BML1X8XK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477112,"name":"Fabritones Shower Curtains with Snap in Liner Hook Free Waffle Pattern Waterproof 71x74 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qBf5KPTbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: 71x74 inch, it has two layers, snap rings with patent which are easy to hook, waffle pattern, top of the curtain has a translucent window, replaceable lining. Quick & Easy To Use With Snap Hook design, you will have a truly no-hassle experience while using our shower curtain. Installation and assembly can be done within seconds, no extra hooks required. Applicable to a wide type of shower rod, which can be slid smoothly and easily. Waterproof The Fabritones shower curtain is a healthy and durable choice for your bathroom. Made from polyester fabric, this white shower curtain doesn’t give off unpleasant odors like PVC or plastic can. Designed to fit standard bathtubs, it's water repellent for a cleaner curtain and dryer bathroom. Reinforced holes for hooks and a weighted bottom keep the shower curtain hanging properly in place. The neutral white color suits any decor style. Easy to Care Machine washable - Fabric stays crisp after multi-washes. Shrink resistance, easy to clean and maintain.Replaceable liner design - You can remove the liner with covered buttons easily and launder without the need to remove the entire shower curtain. Return Policy 30 days Full Refund - If for any reason you are not satisfied, send a simple email and receive a full money-back refund, absolutely no questions asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qBf5KPTbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fabritones","source_asin":"B07VP9VV3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VP9VV3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VP9VV3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
