window.products.push({"id":477220,"name":"150 Pack Popsicle Bags, Ice Pop Bags for Kids Adults, BPA Free Freezer Tubes with Zip Seals, Disposable Ice Popsicle Molds Bags with Funnel for DIY He","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nUPd5a6VL._AC_SL1442_.jpg","description":"Material: Our popsicle bags are made of durable material which is reusable, portable and easy to store can make pouring a breeze. DIY popsicle bags contain 150 pcs Ice pop bags and a silicone funnel per package. Convenient zip seal design: Our freezer pop bags feature a zip seal that makes snacking on the go a breeze. No more struggling to open messy seals or dealing with sticky backpacks. Simply tear away from the notch and enjoy your healthy homemade snack popsicles anywhere, anytime. Ideal snack at the party: If you're going to hold a satisfying pool party or birthday party in limited time, these popsicle bags will be a time and energy saviour. Freeze for a few hours, then all you need to do is to enjoy on the spot with your friends and relatives. Multipurpose: Cut fruits into pieces, prepare smoothies, add any ingredients you want, fill popsicle bags and freeze them for camping, picnics, snacks, kids parties, boating and trips for a fraction of the cost of store bought frozen snacks. Size: Popsicle bags size 1.96 inches wide x 8.66 inches long. When freezing popsicles, the opening of the bag can be slightly higher or freeze upright. (Warm Tips: Don't freeze too full, and make sure to leave about 1/2 inch of space at the top).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nUPd5a6VL._AC_SL1442_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ozera","source_asin":"B0C5RDWWV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5RDWWV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5RDWWV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477221,"name":"Refrigerator Magnets 35-Pack Star Fridge Magnets Cute Colorful Functional Magnets for Office, Kitchen, Refrigerator, Whiteboard Magnet Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oWJJD1HqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Set of 35 pieces star magnets These star magnets works well to any magnetic surfaces, perfect for whiteboard, refrigerator, metal presentation boards, file cabinets, calendars, lockers, and other magnetic surfaces. No damage to surfaces any more. Great gift for friends Great powerful colored magnets for moms, teachers, and office workers anyone who needs to stay organized! Also great for a gift! Specification: Magnets size: 1.2 x 0.08 inch / 3.05 x 0.2 cm for each magnet Color: Red, purple, rose red, yellow, blue, green, orange Quantity: Set of 35 Notices 1.The magnets do not stick to non-metal materials such as wood, glass, plastic, textile, concrete, etc.  2.Don't let children use them alone, it need to be used under the supervision of adults. 3.Storage: Keep these up high and out of reach of children 4.In addition, in accordance with Amazon strong magnet policy, these magnets are not strong magnets because the exposed portion of these magnets all have a north polarity, which allows the magnets to adhere strongly to metal but have a weak connection to each other (flux between magnets is less than 50 kG2mm2). Package includes: 35-Pack Colorful Star Magnets","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oWJJD1HqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Staruby","source_asin":"B09WXXFJH9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WXXFJH9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WXXFJH9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
