window.products.push({"id":477280,"name":"8x10 Picture Frames Set of 2, Rustic L Shaped Double Sided Frame for 8 by 10 Photo, Made of Brown Base and HD Tempered Glass Covers for Table Top Disp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xk3HHBC0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RUSTIC PICTURE FRAMES: This 8x10 photo frame has a unique L-shaped wooden base, with a very durable and beautiful natural wood texture. The thick base allows the photo frame to be firmly placed on your desk. It is very suitable for any modern furniture or rustic farmhouse decor. Floating Frame Size: This 8 by 10 picture frame fits a variety of sizes. 8x10 size photos will create a blank space around it, with a floating effect. The frame is tight to prevent the glass from slipping, it is recommended to place the photo in the center of the frame and use double-sided photos. Suitable for family picture, graduation picture, dog picture, wedding picture, etc. FRAMELESS DESIGN: The 8x10 double sided picture frame has HD tempered glass and the frameless design allows you to easily take out the glass and change the photos in it. You can place it in the office, bedroom, dining room, living room, coffee shop. MULTIFUNCTIONAL USE: Our 8x10 glass picture frame for table top can be displayed horizontally or vertically. Transparent glass and frameless design provide more display options. Not only suitable for your precious photos, but also can display leaf specimens, hand-painted, paper-cut, etc. IDEAL FOR DECORATION AND GIFTS: This vintage texture photo frame is a perfect home decor. Put your meaningful picture in this rustic frame as a gift for mom, grandma, father, lover or friends on Birthday, New Year, housewarming, Anniversary, Mother’s Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xk3HHBC0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lavezee","source_asin":"B09BQNLCGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BQNLCGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BQNLCGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
