window.products.push({"id":477286,"name":"Luxurious Light Weight Goose Down Comforter King Size Duvet Insert, Classic Gray, Premium Baffle Box, 1200 Thread Count 100% Egyptian Cotton Cover, 60","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ce1SGVfXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package contains 1 LUXURIOUS unique CLASSIC GRAY design Goose Down Comforter in a beautiful zippered package. The light weight all season warmth is perfect for warmer sleepers or warmer climates that still want a cozy, fluffy quilt. The lightest, fluffiest, softest, most luxurious comforter designed with 100% Egyptian Cotton cover are truly worthy of a classy elegant suite, and are found in world class hotels. The result is a down comforter so luxurious and soft, you will believe you are truly covering with a cloud, night after night. Filled with fluffy, soft, 60 oz fill weight, inside of an incredible luxuriously soft 100% cotton shell.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ce1SGVfXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Egyptian Cotton Factory Outlet","source_asin":"B07FFMDDPP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FFMDDPP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FFMDDPP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477287,"name":"Floppy Ears Design Simple Faux Suede Microfiber Couch Cover Protector, Extra Wide for Deep Seated Couches (Medium Extra Wide 2 Cushion Couch Loveseat,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lwFrxbRKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If your dogs or cats love to sleep on the couch, the Simple Couch Protector is a simple easy way to keep your furniture clean and fur free. The Protector uses high quality upholstery grade Faux Suede Microfiber fabric. The fabric is soft and luxurious, but tough and durable. The fabric is the perfect balance between preventing fur from flying throughout the room, but is fast and easy to shake out the dirt and fur. Fast and easy to put on and take off. Simply throw the Protector over your couch, tuck it in between the cushions and the Protector will stay in place. Extra Wide Two Cushion Couch 105” x 140” fits deeper or higher three cushion couches. Easy to care for. Machine wash and dry. After washing, the Protector will virtually look as good as new.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lwFrxbRKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Floppy Ears Design","source_asin":"B015WKBC7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015WKBC7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015WKBC7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477288,"name":"Kate Aspen Classic Baby Blocks Favor Boxes with Imprinted Ribbon - Set of 24, Pink (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51igwPI6MbL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer \"A-B-C-D! I wonder what's inside for me!\" Build baby shower suspense and enchant your guests with baby shower favor boxes that sweetly celebrate the new baby, as well as an iconic baby toy. The first four letters of the alphabet appear on the pastel-pink or baby blue cardboard \"block\", and each block arrives with a matching, soft satin imprinted ribbon and bow that says \"It's a Girl!\" or \"It's a Boy!\" and a \"For You\" tag. Stock each block chock-full of chocolates, Jordan almonds, your favorite candy or another tantalizing treat. The blocks measure 2\" square and are sold in sets of 24. Assembly required. Click here to view tag designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51igwPI6MbL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate Aspen","source_asin":"B002R0DT6I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002R0DT6I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002R0DT6I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477289,"name":"Lodge Logic Cast Iron 7-Stick Corn Stick Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZN5SZZY0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Cast iron is cornbread's best friend and the Cornstick pan is a traditional favorite. 12\" x 5 1/2\" overall size Original finish. To season, follow these easy directions - Wash with hot, soapy water and a stiff brush. Rinse and dry thoroughly. Spead a thin coat of solid shortening or vegetable oil over the entire pan including handles and exterior surfaces. Line the lower oven rack with aluminum foil to catch any drippings and preheat oven to 350 degrees. Place cookware upside down on middle rack of oven and bake for 1 hour. Turn off the oven, leaving the cookware in the oven until cool. Your cookware will look slightly brown, instead of the familiar black but it is ready for cooking. It will blacken with cooking. Amazon.com These 4-bite cornsticks are perfect for adults who prefer the crispy exterior to the fluffy interior of cornbread. And this little cast-iron pan is meant to be around forever--the manufacturer has been making them since 1896! Cast iron is the original nonstick cooking surface--with proper care and seasoning, it turns glossy black, with a hard \"crust\" that makes sticking a near-impossibility. If you notice sticking, just follow the included directions for re-seasoning. This pan is about as corny as baking pans get--but in a very tasty way. --Jill Lightner","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZN5SZZY0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B00004S9I6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004S9I6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004S9I6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
