window.products.push({"id":477294,"name":"Olive Oil Dispenser Bottle - 500ml Glass Oil Bottle Cruets No Drip, Oil Container For Vegetable Olive Oil，Glass Oil Dispenser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sdLmIJxjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Olive oil dispenser Friendly advice: The oil spout is made of high quality plastic and silicone. Not made of stainless steel. Features: 1.The Lead-Free Glass is hand made design, which can resist the low temperature shock. 2.Oil dispenser safe. Easy to clean by hand or in the dishwasher. 3.With large bottle neck, It is easy and convenient for you to refill the liquid easily without spill. 4.The dust-proof spout enable the olive oil to be kept in original favor. 5.The bottles have silicone stoppers for freshness and hygiene. 6.The necks are wide enough to add your own ingredients to make infusions. 7.The Lead-Free Glass Dispenser bottle allows for easy controlled pouring,the ample capacity of 500ml holding everything from soy sauce, wine,balsamic vinegar, olive,and canola oil. Perfect for use in your home kitchen and in restaurants. Clean 1.Get moderate toothpaste on the surface of bottle, please keep it dry, then use the brush clean, then use the clean water to wash 2.Put the bottle in the dilute acetic acid for 30 minutes, use the brush clean, then use the clean water to wash 3.Please do not use hot water above 60 ℃ to clean the glass. It may cause the bottle to break Package included: 1 x 500ml bottle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sdLmIJxjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FQD Life","source_asin":"B08D6MDTHD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D6MDTHD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D6MDTHD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477295,"name":"Electric Can Opener for Kitchen & Restaurant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qrUJsEagL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ninja Ultima Kitchen System (BL820) The Ninja Ultima Kitchen System offers beyond professional blade speed and performance in both blending and food processing! With the Dual Stage Blending technology you can create endless possibilities. Pro Variable Speed offers everything from gentle blending to total crushing to nutrient & vitamin extraction. The Nutri Ninja cups are perfect for creating delicious, personalized smoothies for on the go with convenient Sip and Seal lids. With the 64 oz. food processing bowl chop fresh ingredients, mix pizza and cookie dough, or complete your meal prep with the disc attachments. All parts are BPA free and dishwasher safe. Dual Stage Blending Technology Dual Stage Blending is Ninja’s patent pending gear system which offers high torque Total Crushing technology AND high speed cyclonic blending in one jar to crush down ingredients and then liquefy them. The unique technology allows the two sets of blades to rotate at different speeds in order to first crush the larger ingredients and then quickly liquefy the small chunks. Total Crushing blades pulverize and crush through ice, whole fruits and vegetables in seconds. High speed cyclonic blades then puree the ingredients into a smooth, grit-free consistency. XL 8 Cup Food Processing Bowl The Ninja Ultima Kitchen System food processor comes equipped with a high-quality stainless steel chopping blade, dough blade, reversible slicer/shredder disc and grating disc. Attach the chopping blade and process ingredients perfectly or add the dough blade and mix up to 2 pounds of dough in 30 seconds. Evenly and effortlessly slice and shred ingredients using the reversible slicer/shredder disc, or grate cheese with the grating disc! This Ninja Ultima is the ultimate kitchen system allowing you to create quick and convenient healthy homemade meals! Nutri Ninja Nutrient & Vitamin Extraction Nutrient & Vitamin Extraction provides a better tasting, more nutritious kind of beverage. Get a silky smooth cool cup of goodness made entirely from whole fruits, vegetables, and ice cubes. Nutri Ninja technology provides smooth, nutrient-rich beverages filled with vitamins & fiber. Ninja Ultima Kitchen System (BL820) Model - BL820 Model - BL820 Power - 1500 Watts/3 Peak HP Power - 1500 Watts/3 Peak HP Speeds - Pro Variable Speed, 10 Speeds + Pulse Speeds - Pro Variable Speed, 10 Speeds + Pulse Blender Pitcher Capacity - 72 oz. (9 cups) Blender Pitcher Capacity - 72 oz. (9 cups) Blade Technology - Dual Stage Blending (Total Crushing & High Speed Cyclonic Technology) Blade Technology - Dual Stage Blending (Total Crushing & High Speed Cyclonic Technology) Blade Material - Stainless Steel Blade Material - Stainless Steel Food Processor Bowl Capacity - 64 oz. (8 cups) Food Processor Bowl Capacity - 64 oz. (8 cups) Food Processor Attachments - Feed Chute Lid, Chopping Blade, Dough Blade, Reversible Slicing/Shredding Disc, Grating Disc Food Processor Attachments - Feed Chute Lid, Chopping Blade, Dough Blade, Reversible Slicing/Shredding Disc, Grating Disc Nutri Ninja Cup Capacity - 16 oz. (2 cups) Nutri Ninja Cup Capacity - 16 oz. (2 cups) Nutri Ninja Cups Included - 2 Nutri Ninja Cups Included - 2 Cookbook - Ultima Delicious Flipbook Cookbook - Ultima Delicious Flipbook Cord Length - 3 feet Cord Length - 3 feet Warranty - 2 Years Warranty - 2 Years BPA Free BPA Free Dishwasher Safe Dishwasher Safe Whats in the box? 1500 Watt Motor Base, 72oz. Blender Pitcher, Blender Pitcher Lid, Removable Total Crushing Blade Assembly, 64oz. Food Processor Bowl, Flat Lid with Drizzle Hole, Feed Chute Lid with Food Pusher, Chopping Blade, Dough Blade, Reversible Slicer/Shredder Disc, Grating Disc, Disc Adaptor, (2) Nutri Ninja Cups, Nutri Ninja Pro Extractor Blade, (2) Nutri Ninja Sip and Seal To Go Lids, Instruction Book, Ultima Delicious 90 Recipe Flipbook Ninja Ultima FamilyNinja Ultima Blender + with 2 Nutri Ninja Cups (BL810)Ninja Ultima Blender + with 3 Nutri Ninja Cups (BL830)Ninja Ultima Blender + with 3 Nutri Ninja Cups and Cookbook (BL830CB)Ninja Ultima Kitchen System (BL820) 1500 Watts ✓✓✓✓ 72oz. Professional Blender Pitcher ✓✓✓✓ Dual Stage Blending Technology ✓✓✓✓ (2) 16oz. Nutri Ninja Cups with Sip and Seal Lids ✓✓ (3) 16oz. Nutri Ninja Cups with Sip and Seal Lids ✓✓ 64oz. Food Processing Bowl - make 2lbs. of dough! ✓ Reversible Slicing/Shredding Disc and Grating Disc ✓ Ultima Creations 150 Recipe Cookbook ✓","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qrUJsEagL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ninja","source_asin":"B00XQ198GC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XQ198GC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XQ198GC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477296,"name":"Gonesh Everyday Lavender Incense - 4 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cd-g45NKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GONESH EVERYDAY Because life doesn't wait for special occasions. Here's to everyday! To the little things that matter, and matter most. Your personal routine. Your daily rituals. Your ongoing obsessions and quirky habits. You don't need a special occasion to make everyday special, it already is! A light, gentle fragrance outburst from the makers of Ganesh Extra Rich Incense. An incense that truly mixes well with every day. Whether it's bust or robust. Life goes on. Stick with it. About our Incense: Ganesh continually strives to elevate the level of fragrance delivery by working with creative and skilled perfumers, by using the highest quality raw materials, and by our exclusive use of High Charcoal. Unlike wood powder, charcoal produces no smoke- allowing the fragrant oil to vaporize and the scent to come through without smoke. Ganesh Incense has the highest charcoal content of any brand currently on the market - it delivers the purest, cleanest burn, and crystal clear fragrances. About our Company: We're out to change the image of incense in America. By operating in the bustling city of Chicago, we can that our incense is high quality, ethically sourced and environmentally responsible. Today Genieco's Ganesh brand includes a variety of \"green\" and practices, including a recent installation of Solar Panels on our warehouse rooftop. We take great pride in supporting green energy and do our part in reducing our carbon footprint. DIRECTIONS: Hold a lighted match to the coated end of a stick until it glows; blow out flame. Place sticks in an incense holder, a flowerpot, or a glass filled with salt, sand or earth. Be sure that the ashes fall on a fireproof surface. WARNING: Keep burning stick away from flammable articles such as papers, drapes, etc. Do not allow sticks to touch any varnished, painted, plastic, etc. surfaces. Never leave burning incense unattended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cd-g45NKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gonesh","source_asin":"B07J5MF35R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J5MF35R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J5MF35R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
