window.products.push({"id":477325,"name":"CRUNCHCUP A Portable Cereal Cup - No Spoon. No Bowl. It's Cereal On The Go, XL Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MvSSkRfzL._AC_SL1364_.jpg","description":"The perfect companion for any student, parent, or business professional who wants to take their cereal to-go. Easy to assemble. The CrunchCup️ is comprised of two cups; one for the cereal and the other for the milk. Each cup has its own hole so that the cereal and milk don't meet until they hit your mouth. Made of extremely durable, dishwasher-safe, BPA-free plastic. It will not crack if you drop it. Drink your cereal with one hand on-the-go without having to use a spoon. Control the flow of milk by putting your finger on the air hole or by partially covering milk spout with lower lip. The CrunchCup features an open lid design (i.e. the lid does not seal shut). This product is not intended to be placed in bags, lunchboxes, briefcases, backpacks, etc. it is intended to remain upright and to be consumed within 1-1.5 hours to maintain freshness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MvSSkRfzL._AC_SL1364_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CRUNCHCUP","source_asin":"B08ZYTJRTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZYTJRTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZYTJRTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477326,"name":"Boska Raclette Grilling Set - Partyclette Grilling To Go Set - Suitable for Cheese, Meat, Fish, and Vegetables - Portable Non-Stick - Dishwasher Safe ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511D0shYDnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"At Boska Holland we've been crazy about cheese for over 100 years! It all started near Gouda, home of the original Gouda cheeses, where Willem Bos made his first cheese tools for local cheese farmers. From that day it's our family tradition to inspire you on your journey through the delicious cheeses of the world. Wonderful romantic racletting for two? Try for once grilled cheese on a roasted potato. Or on a fresh baguette with a pearl onion, a gherkin and smoked ham. Let's light the candles! You can vary endlessly with the mini raclette. For example, combine the molten cheese with a mini hamburger prepared on the grill plate. For more inspiration and surprising recipes, see Boska's website.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511D0shYDnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B0060BIUDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0060BIUDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0060BIUDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
