window.products.push({"id":477351,"name":"Calphalon Complements Nylon Fork","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JA85G7AML._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Calphalon Complements nylon fork Amazon.com Ideal for carving or serving meat, Calphalons sharp, two-pronged fork firmly grabs and holds. Each prong features an extra small extension designed to grip food and prevent slipping. Lightweight and durably constructed, the tool wont scratch or stain and its functional end resists temperatures up to 400 degrees F. The nylon material safely works with any nonstick or hard-anodized cookware while a comfortable Santoprene handle provides a cushioned, slip-free hold. The tool measures 12-1/2 inches in length and should be hand washed for best long-term results. -- Amy Arnold","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JA85G7AML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B0001BMZN8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001BMZN8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001BMZN8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477352,"name":"COLAMY French Country Dining Chairs Set of 6, Upholstered Farmhouse Dining Room Chairs with Round Back, Solid Wood Legs, Accent Side Chairs for Kitche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":529.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71im0iQjFlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❗❗❗Package Shipping: Shipping with three boxes. If you miss boxes, please feel free to ask Amazon or COLAMY for the second or third tracking number. Notice: each box contains 2 dining chairs; the legs and screws are packed in a zippered compartment at the bottom of the chair seat cushion. 🥂ELEGANT FRENCH RETRO DESIGN -- From slender fluted legs to an iconic rounded backrest and seating, these Louis-style chairs are a classic look that won't go out of style- and they are a favorite look in French country-style dining rooms. 🥂DURABLE & SOLID CONSTRUCTION -- The solid wood frame of farmhouse chairs features hand-carved channels and accents, classically turned legs, wonderfully contrasting lines, and curves, and a distressed finish that gives these pieces a rustic, shabby-chic appeal. 🥂UPHOLSTERED SEAT AND BACK -- The breathable linen look fabric, and high-density sponge cushion provide a first-class comfort experience for you, even if you sit for a long time, you will not feel tired. 🥂VERSATILE SIDE CHAIRS -- These vintage chairs combine old times and modern styles, presenting a unique charm, which will be perfect for indoors, in the living rooms, kitchens, restaurants, etc. Intimate footpads at the bottom to protect the floor from being scratched and accommodate rough ground. 🥂EASY TO ASSEMBLE& WORRY-FREE PURCHASE-- Just need minor assembly. We have one year warranty on the parts of the high-back fabric dining chairs. If any questions about the rustic dining chairs, feel free to contact the manufacturer- COLAMY (contact info in user manual), we will reply to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71im0iQjFlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COLAMY","source_asin":"B0BD7FHJVL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD7FHJVL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD7FHJVL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
