window.products.push({"id":477355,"name":"Homelux Automatic Candle Extinguisher Clip On – Spring-Loaded Automatic Candle Snuffer Ring for Taper Candles – Adjustable, 0.6-1 in. Diameter Swedish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714cpU1seML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elevate How You DecorateBeyond keeping up with TikTok trend items, you want something classy and convenient to wow guests and make cleanup easy. Your Swedish candle snuffers do the job in a snap—and in style. Place your elegant Silver snuffer ring on any taper candle between 0.6 and 1 in., slide it closer to the top for less burn time and further for more, and let your candle snuff itself out. When the wick burns down to your extinguisher, it automatically snaps over the flame without making you blow it out. No electricity, timers, or handheld snuffers are required. Allow yourself to party on without neglecting your bright mesmerizing decorations.Set a Safety NetAs a responsible person, you never leave your lit candles’ flames to dance alone. One can never be too careful, however, which is why you responsibly add an automatic candle snuffer to your candle care kit. Your snuffer isn’t bulky like old-fashioned snuffers, and it’s not made of plastic and cords like the battery-powered ones. Your automatic snuffer puts style back into safety. It extinguishes flames by springing its cap onto the wick when the wax melts down to its level.A Gift with UtilityComplement your neighbor’s candle sticks, give a college freshman their first home essentials, or since your candle snuffers come in a 2-pack, keep a couple for yourself.Whether candles calm you, help you focus, or you just love having a nice set of dripless taper candles handy for dinner parties, you’ll never need to snuff out style with Homelux.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714cpU1seML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homelux","source_asin":"B0BTZQ8JX1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTZQ8JX1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTZQ8JX1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477356,"name":"SMARTRO SC91 Projection Alarm Clock for Bedrooms with Weather Station, Wireless Indoor Outdoor Thermometer, Temperature Humidity Monitor Gauge Hygrome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HnaSfDjhL._AC_.jpg","description":"⏰TIME & TEMPERATURE PROJECTION: Perfect alarm clocks for bedrooms (NOT ATOMIC). The projected temperature changes from indoor temperature to outdoor temperature automatically. Alarm clock projected in a soft red color on ceiling or wall is easy to see throughout the room. Adjustable projection angles and brightness - It can be reversed by 180 degrees for optimal viewing and meet different users’ preferences. ⏰INDOOR/OUTDOOR THERMOMETER GAUGE & HUMIDITY MONITOR: Equipped with professional grade inside outside thermometer and humidity monitor, the clock provides the most accurate measurements. Displayed with Indoor/outdoor temperature and humidity, allows you to be aware if adjustments are necessary. Ideal alarm clock for home, keeps you and your family's living conditions optimal. ⏰WIRELESS COLOR WEATHER STATION: 12/24 hour, date, and weekday in large number; Clear weather patterns, mold alerts and mold risk are displayed on large 4.5” LCD screen. Digital weather station predicts the weather for the next 12 hours as well as the barometric pressure trend and temperature trend. Adjustable backlit dimmer (high- medium - low - out) with DC power adapter, enables you to set the display to a brighter setting in daytime and softer one at night. ⏰WIDE APPLICATION: Connect up to 3 wireless remote sensors for 3 channels (note: package only include 1 sensor, buy separately from our store if you need more). Remote sensor with transmission large range up to 200ft/60m in an open area, you can place the projection clock in your room, and put remote sensors to baby room, warehouse or other places need to gauge. ⏰DUAL ALARMS WITH SNOOZE FUNCTION: Set 2 separate alarms repeating in M-F, S-S, or M-F and S-S for different purposes. The alarm will automatically turn off if left alone for 2 minutes. With snooze function, this projection alarm clock allows you to set 5 ~ 60 minutes’ sleep time or turn SNOOZE function off - A step towards the practical use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HnaSfDjhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMARTRO","source_asin":"B07N2PWWW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N2PWWW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N2PWWW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477357,"name":"DDUP Pizza Storage Container,Expandable Red Pizza Slice Container with Pizza Cutter and 5 Microwavable Trays,Reusable Pizza Keeper of Leftover Pizza","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zG1+By1qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【A Great Way to Store Pizzas】Every pizza slices can be folded into this big and sturdy pizza storage container.Our pizza container is collapsible and can be extended.It's easy for you to store the leftover pizza and take up less space in the fridge with the help of our pizza container. 【Keeps Pizza Longer and Fresher】Make better taste of packing pizza.The pizza slice container is equipped with Snap-on lids and seals provide a tight seal to keep your pizza slices fresh longer, each pizza container provides a vent to reduce condensation. 【Save Food Securely with Ease】This reusable pizza Keeper box is made with non-toxic, food-grade silicone materials,it is odorless, BPA excluded,leak-proof and non-stick. They are also be used safely in the microwave, freezer,dishwasher and can be cleaned easily. 【Cutting Pizzas into Slices】This pizza containers are equipped with 18/8 stainless steel cutter for cutting pizzas into slices.With this useful tool,it will be very easy for you to divide and store leftover pizzas. 【Save The Food You like】Our pizza containers with lids is lightweight,collapsible and portable, suitable for kitchen, dorms, RVs, camping, BBQ, travel or picnics etc. It is multifunctional - Not only can store pizza, but also other foods such as cheese, bacon, pie, ham, vegetables, fruits, etc can be stored. This a good way to store the food you like and save spaces in the fridge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zG1+By1qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DDUP","source_asin":"B0BR7P6NHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR7P6NHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR7P6NHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
