window.products.push({"id":477380,"name":"Picture Frame Home Decor Photo Frame for Sister, 4x6 Inches Photo, Birthday Gifts for Women Wall Hanging Photo Show, Side by Side Or Miles Apart Siste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lczX+pj7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Good Quality Picture Frame】This picture frame fit on 4x6 inches photograph is made of good quality solid wood and durable P2 MDF backplane. This photo frame with glass helps to protect the quality of the photo, and can prevent the photo from discoloration, yellowing, wrinkle, etc., so that your photos will stay clean and beautiful for a long time without being damaged. 【2 In 1 Photo Frame Hanging On The Wall & Placed On The Table】The photo frame comes with a rope for hanging the photo frame. You can choose to hang your favorite photos in the living room or bedroom to decorate your home and room. You can also put the photo frame on any table as home decor or desk placement. 【Simple And Stylish Greeting Card & Ideal Gift】This picture frame \"Side by Side Or Miles Apart Sisters Are Close to The Heart\" is very suitable for sisters.The greeting card is packed in simple, stylish and beautiful envelopes, and is beautifully made. You can write your best wishes and wishes to your sister on the greeting card. Can be used as Birthday gifts, Christmas gifts, New Year gifts, Thanksgiving gifts. 【Perfect Gift Box】This is a high-end gift box with foam cushion and greeting card. You can give it as a gift to the person you want. He/she will be pleasantly surprised to receive this interesting gift. This will be the most memorable gift. 【Most Important】We always hope to provide the best quality products and services. Hope you have a pleasant shopping experience. If you have any questions, suggestions or ideas, please feel free to contact us. Your satisfaction is our greatest hope, I wish you find the goods you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lczX+pj7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EKDJKK","source_asin":"B08ZJGVQ6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZJGVQ6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZJGVQ6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477381,"name":"BOSKA Pitcher, Glass, Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mmOvF+QOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Boska Holland we've been crazy about cheese for over 100 years. It all started near Gouda, home of the original Gouda cheeses, where Willem Boz made his first cheese tools for local cheese farmers. From that day it's our family tradition to inspire you on your journey through the delicious cheeses of the world. Explore cheese and enjoy it. Boska represents beautiful, smart products for cheese. part of the Boska Holland Life Collection which is a unique combination of authentic quality, tasteful design and a dash of tradition. These organically designed products are made of solid natural material, like European white oak with a beautiful coarse grain, rugged concrete and recycled glass. The cheese accessories were created to highlight the pure enjoyment of cheese. With the pure life in mind, Boska brings a set of 3 glasses and a carafe made of 100-percent recycled glass. The carafe and the glass are robustly shaped and therefore really stylish. The carafe and the glass are an addition to every collection and a must-have for everyone who likes beautiful glasses. The carafe is made of 100-percent recycled glass and is stamped with \"Authentic Glass, 100-percent recycled\" and holds a volume of 1 liter/33.81 Fl. Oz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mmOvF+QOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B009AVIDWM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009AVIDWM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009AVIDWM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
