window.products.push({"id":477407,"name":"NIINTWES Simple Syrup Dispenser Glass Bottle, Syrup Bottles Glass, No Drip Premium Glass with Stainless Steel Top, 7oz Diamond Shape, Oil Dispenser Di","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yajixNHYS._AC_.jpg","description":"✿NO MESSY, STICKY LEAKS: our NIINTWES simple syrup dispenser provides you mess-free surfaces, no need a syrup pump bottle or a jar with a dipper which will drip everywhere. Especially in a busy morning, no waiting and shaking the glass syrup bottle to get your favorite sauce flowing, all you need to do is to press the handy trigger to release syrup or other liquid evenly. ✿NO DISAPPOINTED MATERIALS: instead of plastic, we choose stainless steel for top of the glass syrup dispenser which is tougher to release sauces. Our syrup dispenser glass comes with heavy duty premium glass body and a silicone sealed gasket to keep your syrup airtight. All parts of the simple syrup dispenser can be safely washed in wash machines. ✿NO SINGLE APPLICATION: this syrup dispenser glass bottle is just the right amount- 7 oz (200ml) capacity, for kids and adults to use it as olive oil dispenser, maple syrup dispenser, pancake syrup dispenser, coffee syrup dispenser and sugar dispenser, even you can store body oil in this bottle, so the oil dispenser glass provides countless applications in your kitchen, cafe, restaurant, bar, spa etc. ✿NO BORING SHAPE: this syrup dispenser no drip has beautiful diamond shape design which is more unique and creative, without your food getting clumpy. This great-looking honey. bottle is a must-have for your dinning table in kitchen! ✿NO WORRIES OF GIFT IDEA: the syrup bottle dispenser will be a sweet gift for your family members and friends. It is a thoughtful and useful present for mothers day, birthday, home warming, wedding, anniversary and Christmas. ✔ PLEASE PLEASE NOTE: according to customers’ suggestions, HONEY will not work in this syrup dispenser glass!! ✔Customer Service: If you have any questions please contact us, we will reply you asap ♥ We aim to spoil every customer ♥pack includes: a syrup bottle and a sponge brush","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yajixNHYS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NIINTWES","source_asin":"B08XYMNGKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XYMNGKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XYMNGKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477408,"name":"Viking Culinary Blue Carbon Steel 2-Piece Nonstick Fry Pan Set, 10 Inch & 12 Inch, Ergonomic Stay-Cool Handle, Grill, Oven Safe, Works on All Cooktops","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yCDf5+d8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For those who like cooking with cast iron but love the versatility of a clad stainless steel pan, shop the Viking Blue Carbon Steel 2-piece Fry Pan set. Featuring both a 10’’ and 12’’ size for added versatility, this fry pan set is made of carbon steel, an alloy that is a combination of iron and carbon. The “Blue” in “Blue carbon steel” references a heat treatment process to help resist rust and corrosion, a nuisance that can plague traditional cast iron pans. Stay-cool cast iron handles securely attach to the pans with heavy duty rivets for confidence in construction and a lifetime of use.Though cast iron also excels as maintaining even heating, it can take time to rise to temperature and since iron itself is so brittle, more of the material must be used to make it durable, making traditional cast iron pans larger and heavier. With blue carbon steel, you’ll have a pan that is noticeably lighter without sacrificing performance. And like cast iron, blue carbon steel also heats quickly and evenly, reducing the risk of hot spots from occurring. Blue carbon steel is also prized for achieving high temperatures quickly without fear of damage occurring to the pan itself. Viking Blue Steel is oven safe to 450°F for restaurant quality finishing in the oven.Like cast iron, your blue carbon steel pans will need to be seasoned regularly to maintain its nonstick properties. “Seasoning” refers to the process of coating the base of the pan with a thin layer of oil that imparts a flavorful taste to your foods while also protecting foods from sticking. There are plenty of methods to seasoning your pan, but if this is your first time seasoning the pan, we recommend using very hot water and dish soap to first scrub the pan, then wipe dry and place it on the burner at low heat to finish drying. Add some oil to the pan and cook over medium heat for about 10 minutes. Then, let the pan cool and wipe with paper towels and your pan is ready for use! For future maintenance, simply rinse the pan with water after use and scrub gently with a soft-bristled brush or sponge if necessary (No need for soap!). Season with vegetable oil periodically to maintain its smooth cooking surface and nonstick properties. It is not recommended to put these pans into the dishwasher as it will remove the seasoning, reduction the natural nonstick and making the pan more susceptible to rust. Should you find rust on the pan, like natural cast iron, this can be normal. Just clean the rust off with a scrubby sponge and season the area with vegetable oil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yCDf5+d8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Culinary","source_asin":"B0B5S9F1SV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5S9F1SV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5S9F1SV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
