window.products.push({"id":477452,"name":"Luxury Non-Slip Plush Bathroom Rug - Machine-Washable 20\"X32\" Floor Mat for Bath, Toilet, Living Room, Bedroom and Kitchen, 100% Super Absorbent Micro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zwKUniIKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Does your bathroom get super slippery right after you bathe or shower? Many bathroom tiles and flooring materials can get slippery when wet. This can be dangerous especially for kids and toddlers. You can use rubber mats on the floor to make it slip-resistant, but those could be really cold underfoot. Everyone wants something safe and comfortable to step on when they use the bathroom. There are many different types of rugs available on the market so you have to be extra careful about the type that you buy. Walk out of the shower safely and comfortably with the help of the DreamMat4U Bathroom Rug! The bathroom is one of the most used rooms in a house so it is but right to make it safe and comfortable for everyone in the family to use. Our bathmat is not like any other rug out there. It is professionally designed to absorb water effectively, keeping your feet and the floor dry enough for safe walking. We’ve added an anti-slip latex backing keeps the mat in place. No matter from which angle you step on the rug, it won’t slip away or drag you with it. Plus, it has a microfiber surface with a unique fiber-locking technique that makes it extra soft, fluffy and warm on bare feet. More reasons to love our super soft bathroom mat: 🛀 Use it as a doormat in any entryway at home to keep dust away 🛀 It is a great option for your pets enjoy sleeping on these mats. It could be a great gift for your cute dogs and cats 🛀 Machine-washable, hang to air-dry and available in two neutral colors that blend well with any color or design theme: White and Beige Enhance your shower and bathroom experience with our plush DreamMat4U Bathroom Rug and complete with luxurious, dense, shag pile and non-slip backing. Add it to your cart TODAY! There may be a little color difference due to the lighting effect when photographer took the photo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zwKUniIKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Green Touch","source_asin":"B07M8CVHSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M8CVHSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M8CVHSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
