window.products.push({"id":477527,"name":"LE TAUCI Chip and Dip Bowls, Anti-Soggy Cereal Bowl, Soup and Side/Cracker Bowls Sets for Breakfast, Soup and Sandwich, Bread Dipping Bowls, Set of 2,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gsW0zuE6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say Good Bye to The Soggy Cereal - A partitioned system allows cereal to sit above, looking over into a valley of wet, milky lowlands. As you eat, you can push cereal over the slanted ledge into the milk, creating the perfect, crunchy, forbidden romance of a single bite without tainting the rest of your cereal, which waits eagerly for that perfect match. Large Deep Versatile Bowl - The two partitions of the bowl are designed to be large enough so that you can better hold any food you want.Suitable for adults or children to eat alone, put rice and soup separately inside, not worry about spillage leading to cross contamination of flavors. Ceramic Material, A Better Choice - Ceramic is more stable and can be suitable for higher temperatures than plastic which is too light and not very heat resistant. You can put it in the microwave before meals without worrying about any problems. The thick texture gives it a more balanced center of gravity and allows you to put in full food but not tip over. Easy to Clean - Glazed ceramics have a comfortable feel, resist to odor and stains which can last for years. Smooth Glaze make it easy to clean. Just place them in your dishwasher.Simultaneous streamlined design and sleek finish ensure timeless beauty. Careful Packaging, Ideal Gift - Since we regard the product as the return of your hard-earned money, the packaging of our products is carefully checked to ensure that each product is delivered to you safely. It is the ideal gift for cereal lovers, snackers, and people who live alone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gsW0zuE6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LE TAUCI","source_asin":"B09VRRTMJB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VRRTMJB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VRRTMJB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
