window.products.push({"id":477666,"name":"BNSPLY Hall Tree with Bench and Shoe Storage, 3 in 1 Entryway Bench with Coat Rack, Mudroom Bench with Storage and 4 Double Hooks, Entryway Furniture ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":305.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nGNuSOzNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏡WELCOME YOU HOME: This smart hall tree with bench and shoe storage helps you keep your entryway neat and tidy while giving a unique and stylish look. After coming back home at the end of the day, just hang your coat, hat, and scarves on the top 4 double hooks, sit on the bench to remove your shoes, and put them in the cabinet. Invites guest to feel at home 👚ALL IN ONE PIECE: Coat rack, shelf, storage cabinet and bench all in one. This multifunction entryway bench with coat rack comes with 2 open shelves at the top, 2 openable storage cabinet at the bottom, 4 double-sided silver hooks and a spacious bench, which provides heaps of storage for your entrance. It’s ideal for storing and organizing coat, hat, dog Leash, bench towels, picnic blankets and more 👍RELIABLE & DURABLE: The mudroom bench with storage and hooks is made of particleboard and MDF veneer primarily, which has excellent stability. The bench can load up to 220lbs. The load-bearing capacity of each hook can reach 6 lbs. Personal items such as clothes, hats, scarves, dog leashes and bags can be placed to make your home more tidy. In addition, we provided an anti-tip device to ensure a safe home 👟SIMPLE MODERN STYLE: The coat rack, shoe cabinet, storage and porch tree are combined to reduce unnecessary space occupation. Simple lines and simple colors make this coat rack shoe bench a great furniture in your home, it is very suitable for entrance, hall, foyer, hallway, porch, ect ☎️100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION: It seems that we’re always in a hurry before heading out. That’s why we made assembly easy and quick with numbered parts and clear instructions. Our product's will shipping form US warehouse. If you have any mud room organization and storage bench questions, pls feel free to contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nGNuSOzNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BNSPLY","source_asin":"B0BV6T43S8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV6T43S8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV6T43S8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
