window.products.push({"id":477710,"name":"2 Tier Bathroom Sink Organizer with Sliding Basket Drawers, Multi-Purpose Under Sink Organizers and Storage, Pull Out Under Sink and Kitchen Counterto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OqxuNr3LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Removable Sliding Basket Organizer】The bathroom sink organizer adopts a removable storage drawer design that can along the track and slide freely. With mesh design, for easily visualize and ventilated, smooth rails ensure smooth sliding without jams, allows you easier access to all of the stuff you’re storing under the sink. 【 Expanded Storage Space】This under sink pull out organizer features 2 tier sliding wire drawer design, enlarge the limited sink space and providing ample storage, neatly store bathroom supplies or kitchen necessities. 【 Large Capacity-Perfect Size 】Measures 14.2\" L x 11\" W x 16.5\" H assembled.The bottom drawer of this pull out home organizer can hold items up to about 10 inches high, It's large enough to hold things like kitchen and bahthroom cleaning supplies and tall jars of spices, all of them could stand here straightly. the 3.6\" height of the sliding basket can prevent items from falling. This 2 tier pull out under sink organizer can be placed in most American houses storage space. 【 Stability Construction 】 the bathroom under sink storage is made of high quality carbon steel, has a stable structure and high load-bearing capacity, each layer of the under sink organizers and storage can support 30 pounds. The outer layer is sprayed with black paint, which can effectively prevent the shelf from rusting. 【 Multi-Purpose Pull-out Home Storage Organizer 】Modern and simple nordic style design can be matched well with most household style. The 2 tier sliding under bathroom sink organizer can be used as a makeup drawer in bathroom, a pull out snack organizer in pantry room, a spice basket in kitchen and it also can be used in your cabinet to save more space. Put away the clutter, the storage basket helps us relax and takes our mind away from anxiety. Exquisite life, starts at storage. 【Easy To Clean& Installation】The bathroom organizer under sink is easy to clean, just need to wipe the surface with a damp cloth, and keep it dry. The package contains all the necessary tools and a detailed installation guide, just follow the instructions and the installation can be completed in a few minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OqxuNr3LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion&cool","source_asin":"B0B97B4BGG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B97B4BGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B97B4BGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
