window.products.push({"id":477941,"name":"12 Matboard Music notes - Largest 8.9 inch - 10 Minute Install- Not Vinyl Decal or Peel Stick - 1/16 inch Thick matboard - Easily Tak-it-Up with Plast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P0Chghy4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"12 Large Music Notes Largest is 8 inches tall Each pack includes 12 notes and a 1/2 oz pack of ‘PLASTI-TAK’ our re-usable adhesive putty, Not a decal !! “But how do they stick?” Simply apply a small piece (or roll into thin string shape) of PLASTI-TAK onto the back of the note in 2-3 spots and press & stick to ANY surface Not only does this make our product unique, it is also versatile, allowing you to move them from wall to wall with ease leaving no stains or sticky residue, we like to call this “no mess, no fuss!” home décor. Each note is laser-cut from thick mat board and can be painted, glitter-fied, bedazzled and bejeweled! Easy-to-use Directions: To remove, grip item with two hands and slide it down slowly, the non-drying Plasti-Tak will release. Pack arrives ready to use. Guaranteed Removable Repositionable Paintable, paint the back and place it on a mirror for a cool 3D effect, so get creative. Use on a dry wall, hardly any prep required. Our suggested size does not limit you from placing the words in any form or direction to fill your desired space, so get creative No damage to painted walls Leaves no sticky residue Quick to apply Ideal for Long Term or Temporary use NOT a vinyl decal… looks like a decal, sticks up like a poster - 1/16 inch matte board Textured walls NO problem - no squeegee, tape, rulers or pulling off liners involved!!!! Use carefully on poor quality painted walls i.e. primer only Why Tak n Stik Wall Décor and Quotes Our products solve almost all the 1 star reviews on decals in that you don’t have the difficult issues sticking them up. Give your space an instant make-over with Tak n Stik quick and easy to use matboard Wall Decor. Designed for quick and easy application, every pack includes about ½ oz of our revolutionary non-drying adhesive putty specifically formulated over 40 years. carefully where the wall only has a weak primer base paint on the wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P0Chghy4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tak n Stik","source_asin":"B07QD2K63G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QD2K63G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QD2K63G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
