window.products.push({"id":477953,"name":"YSZL Artificial Silk Yellow Sunflower in Woven Vase Arrangement for Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ciunEIIWL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This lifelike artificial sunflower arrangement with woven design vase will be the perfect complement to any decor, or an easy way to add life and color to your home, office or as a gift. It potted 5 sunflower heads, 9 small sunflower heads and some small plants. No arranging is necessary.   Material: Silk leaves, silk flowers, plastic stems, woven vase Crafts: Hand-made Whole Size: 5.5*5.5*11 inches (14*14*28cm)  Vase Size: 5.5*5.5*4.3 inches (14*14*11cm)  Flower Diameter: 4.1 inches (10.5cm), 2.8 inches (7cm), 0.8 inches (2cm)  Net Weight: 0.9lb  Package: 1 x silk sunflower in pot  Tips:  * Please note that color difference does exist between images and actual product due to lighting in photography.  * Because it sometimes compresses during shipping, you may need to primp its branches and leaves once it arrives.  * These silk material with good coloring and high simulation. Due to the silk cloth material, the edge will have a fabric fiber cutting marks.  *There would be accumulated dust if you put it in a place for very long time, you can use the hair dryer with cold wind to remove the dust.  *Please don't put it under strong sunshine. You'd better to dry it by the natural wind, or it will easily fade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ciunEIIWL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YSZL","source_asin":"B07M9JXWJ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M9JXWJ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M9JXWJ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477954,"name":"Portable Space Heater, 950W PTC Ceramic Electric Mini Shaking Head Heater, Small Indoor Desk Heater for Home, Office, Bedroom with Thermostat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610PFhe5NzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3S Fast Heating】This Space Heater uses PTC ceramic heating technology, which can quickly generate heat in 3 seconds, cold / hot air 2 modes to choose from, you can use it both for winter and summer. The powerful heat brings you a warm experience in the cold winter. 【70 ° Oscillation Low Noise】Gently press the swing button, automatic oscillation provides 70 ° high angle heating, the small heater can bring you a wider warmth. The heater noise is less than 36 decibels. Indoor use of personal heaters. Ideal for sleeping, learning, reading or work. 【Safe Space Heater】 Space heater will be auto-off when fall down. Overheating protection will shut heater off automatically when the heater overheat. Preventing safety accidents is safe and reliable.The heater will accompany you to spend warm and comfortable winter. 【Mini Portable Space Heater】 This mini electric heater is only 5.5*5.5*8inches light weight, easy to carry, so you easily bring the heater to anywhere you want, suitable for living room, bedroom or office, mini space. 【Easy to Operate】Heater will turn to SOFT mode, indicator light on the base holder is dark red; Blue light on ,PTC stops working the fan runs and blows the regular wind. Easy to Operate, adopt touch screen control:the electric heater is simple to control.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610PFhe5NzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZIMFANQI","source_asin":"B09DLBX4V9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DLBX4V9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DLBX4V9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477955,"name":"Picklemeister Waterless Silicone Airlock Fermentation lids for mason jars 4 pack (Regular small mouth)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZDJloQdOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the Picklemeister waterless airlock mason jar lids you can have lactic acid fermented vegetables such as dill pickles, sauerkraut or kimchi on your table in just 4-5 days. Please note this is 4 lids only and dosn't include the jar. It is made to fit a standard mouth mason jar. It will not fit a wide mouth jar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZDJloQdOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Picklemeister","source_asin":"B071HXGXLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071HXGXLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071HXGXLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":477956,"name":"Magnasonic MAG-MM171K AM/FM Projection Alarm Clock Radio with Battery Backup & Dual Time Display","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yYsxbtCSL._AC_.jpg","description":"No more struggling to see the time when you wake up. With Magnasonic's Projection Clock Radio, you can see what time it is as soon as you open your eyes. The projector on this alarm clock allows you to display the time on your ceiling or wall, so the time will always be in full view when you need it. The swiveling projector can be tilted a full 180 degrees, enabling you to project the time virtually anywhere. The adjustable focus knob allows the time to be projected clearly for easy viewing, and projection can be turned on and off as desired. When the projection is turned off, you can easily view the time on the unit's 0.6\" green LED display. The Projection Clock Radio comes with a built-in AM/FM tuner so you can wake up leisurely to your favorite radio station. Or if you're more of a heavy sleeper, you can choose the available buzzer alarm function. The battery backup feature ensures the alarm will always activate, even in the event of a power outage. Simply place a 9-volt battery in the unit and it will automatically switch to battery operation when power is lost. This clock radio as some useful alarm features such as the auto shut-off - after the alarm is sounded for 2 hours, it will automatically deactivate. The snooze function will turn the alarm off for 9 minutes at a time, allowing you to squeeze in some extra sleep. The programmable sleep timer function will play the radio while you're falling asleep, but will automatically shut off after a specified period of time from 1-59 minutes. List of Contents: AM/FM Projection Clock Radio, instruction manual, 1 year manufacturer's direct warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yYsxbtCSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magnasonic","source_asin":"B003LZDBMU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003LZDBMU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003LZDBMU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
