window.products.push({"id":477997,"name":"Mighty Pizza Oven 2: Convert your Backyard Gas Grill into an Energy-efficient & High-temperature Pizza Oven – Bake Pro-quality Pizzas in 2-4 Minutes; ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dLxpgBBJL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"The Mighty Pizza Oven is made of durable stainless steel and converts your gas grill into a high-temperature pizza oven for a fraction of the cost of a professional oven.   It is designed to fit on top of a standard gas grill and use the intense heat from the grill's flame to reproduce the ideal baking conditions inside a traditional brick oven. The result is delicious restaurant-quality pizzas baked in 2 to 4 minutes. The Mighty Pizza Oven cooks your pizzas in 3 ways: 1) Conduction: The high-quality cordierite stone at the base of the Mighty Pizza Oven distributes heat evenly to your pizza dough by direct contact, resulting in a crisp and crunchy pizza base with a delicious, soft inside.   2) Radiant Heat: Another cordierite stone above your pizza heats up and reflects the heat evenly back on to the pizza topping and the top part of the crust, cooking your pizza to perfection and giving it a mouth-watering golden-brown color. You can adjust the top stone in 3 positions, to bake or cook other than pizza.   3) Convection: The Mighty Pizza Oven's adjustable vent and chimney system draws in fresh air. This air is heated up and circulated over your pizza to make sure the topping ingredients retain their natural texture and flavor and do not dry out. How to use the Mighty Pizza Oven The Mighty Pizza Oven is really simple to use! Remove the bottom pizza stone and heat the Mighty Pizza Oven and top stone on your grill for 15 minutes. Then lift the oven's lid, place the bottom stone on your grill, beneath the Mighty Pizza Oven, and heat for another 15 minutes and you're ready to bake. That’s all there is to it! Please note-Your grilling surface should have an area of at least 17”x17”x8” to accommodate and open the Mighty Pizza Oven with ease","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dLxpgBBJL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mighty Pizza Oven","source_asin":"B00G8ECGQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-477997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G8ECGQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G8ECGQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
